    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classScene" kindref="compound">Scene</ref> class that manages an ECS registry with sprite entities. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classECSScene" kindref="compound">ECSScene</ref> provides a high-level interface for creating and rendering sprite entities using the ECS pattern. It holds the registry, shader, and graphics buffers needed for rendering.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classRenderSystem" kindref="compound">RenderSystem</ref>, entt::registry </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
